SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Pacer - Temporary Fee Increase Effective Jan.
  1\, 2027
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday\, September 2\, 2026\nOn Jan. 1\, 2027\, a temporary
  increase in fees for electronic access to court records will take effect 
 to help reimburse the costs of the development of the new case management 
 and public access system.\nThe increase of two cents per page\, from 10 ce
 nts to 12 cents\, was approved by the Judicial Conference’s Executive Co
 mmittee on behalf of the Judicial Conference of the United States. In addi
 tion\, the automatic exemption for PACER fees was raised from $30 to $40 p
 er quarter\, ensuring that most individual users (those who use $40 or les
 s in PACER services per quarter) would continue to incur no fee or fee inc
 rease.\nThe fee increase will remain in place for a five-year period.\nRel
 ated links:\nJudiciary Approves Funding for Case Management Modernization\
 nJudges Outline Accelerated Modernization of Case Management System\nhttps
 ://www.meb.uscourts.gov/news/pacer-temporary-fee-increase-effective-jan-1-
 2027
URL:https://www.meb.uscourts.gov/news/pacer-temporary-fee-increase-effecti
 ve-jan-1-2027
CATEGORIES:Curated Role Feeds
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
