SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Section 45: Hospital Non-Claims Payment Sched
 ule for October 2026
DESCRIPTION:Maine.gov\nAgencies\n|\nOnline Services\n|\nHelp\n|\nSearch Ma
 ine.gov\nDHHS\n→\nOffice of MaineCare Services (OMS)\n→\nProvider Reso
 urces\n→\n	 \n			Section 45: Hospital Non-Claims Payment Schedule for Oc
 tober 2026\nSection 45: Hospital Non-Claims Payment Schedule for October 2
 026\nAug 31\, 2026\nAs\npreviously communicated\n\, the Office of MaineCar
 e Services (OMS) is preparing to launch an upgraded version of the Maine I
 ntegrated Health Management Solution (MIHMS)\, MaineCare’s claims proces
 sing system. To support a smooth transition\, OMS must implement temporary
  system access limitations and adjustments to payment cycles in October.\n
 MaineCare will distribute\ntwo separate\nhospital Prospective Interim Paym
 ents (PIPs) the week of September 28\, 2026. MaineCare will\nnot\ndistribu
 te PIPs the week of October 5\, 2026.\nFor questions\, please contact\nAma
 nda Lee\n\, Rate Setting Coordinator.\nOther System Access Limitations\nPr
 oviders can find other expected impacts of the data freeze\nin this FAQ.\n
 Topics include:\nOctober payment schedule\nHealthPAS Online Portal\, inclu
 ding impacts on submitting claims\, submitting prior authorizations\, and 
 checking member eligibility\nProvider Enrollment Application (PEA)\nValue-
 Based Purchasing Management System (VMS) Portal\nPaper & fax document subm
 issions\nProvider Services & Member Services call centers\nValue Added Net
 work (VAN) Trading Partners\nPrior authorizations for prescriptions and be
 havioral health services\nElectronic Visit Verification (EVV)\nYou can als
 o check the OMS\nProvider Resources\nwebpage\, in the first box of informa
 tion called “Health PAS Online Portal\,” for the most recent informati
 on about the upgrade.\nhttps://www.maine.gov/dhhs/oms/providers/provider-b
 ulletins/section-45-hospital-non-claims-payment-schedule-october-2026-2026
 -08-31
URL:https://www.maine.gov/dhhs/oms/providers/provider-bulletins/section-45
 -hospital-non-claims-payment-schedule-october-2026-2026-08-31
CATEGORIES:Curated Role Feeds
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
